nty","/arc-plc/alabama/chilton-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 10 grids runs from 1951 to 2025, and April to May came in under 90% of normal in 36 of those 75 years. In 2025, September to October came in at 49% of normal on the middle of the grids, and November to December did the same at 49%. So far in 2026, February to March sits at 56% of normal and March to April at 59%.</p>"}
